{"ready": {"clock": "ready", "domain": "home", "beat": 0}, "script": "Script of the home (home): the flat's devices: a light, a TV and two ventilation units; each switched on or off on request, or by the night and away scenes; a command is done or refused with a reason\n- move on: \"I turn {D} on.\"; needs cmd on(D), off(D), reachable(D) (kept); leaves on(D), done(on).\n- move on already: \"{D} is already on.\"; needs cmd on(D), on(D) (kept); leaves refused(on).\n- move on unreachable: \"I can't turn {D} on: it does not answer on the network.\"; needs cmd on(D), off(D) (kept), unreachable(D) (kept); leaves refused(on).\n- move on nothing: \"I can't turn that on: it is not a device I know in this home.\"; needs cmd on(nothing); leaves refused(on).\n- move off: \"I turn {D} off.\"; needs cmd off(D), on(D), reachable(D) (kept); leaves off(D), done(off).\n- move off already: \"{D} is already off.\"; needs cmd off(D), off(D) (kept); leaves refused(off).\n- move off unreachable: \"I can't turn {D} off: it does not answer on the network.\"; needs cmd off(D), on(D) (kept), unreachable(D) (kept); leaves refused(off).\n- move off nothing: \"I can't turn that off: it is not a device I know in this home.\"; needs cmd off(nothing); leaves refused(off).\n- move night: \"Good night: I turn the light, the TV and the lab ventilation off; the bedroom ventilation stays as it is.\"; needs cmd night; leaves want off(light), want off(tv), want off(vent lab), done(night).\n- move away: \"You are leaving: I turn everything off.\"; needs cmd away; leaves want off(light), want off(tv), want off(vent lab), want off(vent bedroom), done(away).\n- move scene off: \"I turn {D} off for the scene.\"; needs want off(D), on(D), reachable(D) (kept); leaves off(D), switched(D).\n- move scene kept: \"{D} was already off.\"; needs want off(D), off(D) (kept); leaves kept(D).\n- move scene missed: \"I could not turn {D} off: it does not answer on the network.\"; needs want off(D), on(D) (kept), unreachable(D) (kept); leaves missed(D).\n- move query on: \"I tell you that {D} is on.\"; needs cmd query(D), on(D) (kept); leaves done(query).\n- move query off: \"I tell you that {D} is off.\"; needs cmd query(D), off(D) (kept); leaves done(query).\n- move query nothing: \"I can't say: that is not a device I know in this home.\"; needs cmd query(nothing); leaves refused(query).\n- move time: \"I tell you the time.\"; needs cmd time; leaves done(time).\n- move date: \"I tell you the date.\"; needs cmd date; leaves done(date).\n- move chat: \"I answer in kind.\"; needs cmd chat; leaves done(chat).\n- move unknown: \"I can't do that: it is not something this home can do.\"; needs cmd unknown; leaves refused(unknown).\n- things it counts: on; off; reachable; unreachable; cmd on; cmd off; cmd night; cmd away; cmd query; cmd time; cmd date; cmd chat; cmd unknown; want off; switched; kept; missed; done; refused"}
